d","size":2241396,"digest":"sha256:34214332b9a939baa51197532fc436ad05859e9b81dcefa4e0f8a9b6257e7b83","download_count":31,"created_at":"2026-09-27T12:00:02Z","updated_at":"2026-09-27T12:00:02Z"},{"id":592837964,"node_id":"RA_kwDOQydsfM4jVf1M","name":"vortix-x86_64-unknown-linux-musl.tar.xz.sha256","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/octet-stream","state":"uploaded","size":107,"digest":"sha256:1c4b20b885bb3e5529c76bc1cfb5b7edc3a727909823c2a0914404bd85c8b8e8","download_count":1,"created_at":"2026-09-27T12:00:02Z","updated_at":"2026-09-27T12:00:02Z"},{"id":592837966,"node_id":"RA_kwDOQydsfM4jVf1O","name":"vortix.rb","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/x-ruby","state":"uploaded","size":2539,"digest":"sha256:6363eb1c7e9b86f65c5951afc08c7ab9200830078be977ebbc7c7858482c7ca9","download_count":1,"created_at":"2026-09-27T12:00:02Z","updated_at":"2026-09-27T12:00:02Z"},{"id":592840422,"node_id":"RA_kwDOQydsfM4jVgbm","name":"vortix_0.5.2_amd64.deb","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/x-debian-package","state":"uploaded","size":2914164,"digest":"sha256:36993c2e6fbfe16948628069f65ccb74bcea040cdc4b2eda35831aa082442e5a","download_count":8,"created_at":"2026-09-27T12:01:25Z","updated_at":"2026-09-27T12:01:25Z"},{"id":592840424,"node_id":"RA_kwDOQydsfM4jVgbo","name":"vortix_0.5.2_arm64.deb","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/x-debian-package","state":"uploaded","size":2869094,"digest":"sha256:81f774994a03b63ec916ad9475bc6af1bfd343cb765d1fa35760787a477d890e","download_count":2,"created_at":"2026-09-27T12:01:25Z","updated_at":"2026-09-27T12:01:25Z"}],"body":"## Release Notes\n\n### Highlights\n\n- **Packages for Debian, Ubuntu and Fedora.** Each release now carries `.deb` and `.rpm` packages for amd64 and arm64. They install Vortix to `/usr/bin`, so `sudo vortix` works without a symlink, and bring `wireguard-tools` and `openvpn` with them. Download them from the release page and install with `sudo apt install ./vortix_*.deb` or `sudo dnf install ./vortix-*.rpm`. ([#345](https://github.com/Harry-kp/vortix/pull/345))\n\n### Fixed\n\n- **The in-app help matches the dashboard.** The Roles tab lists the labels the Connection Details panel really shows, the Keys tab includes `f` (flip a panel), and the switch entry says the conflicting tunnel is stopped and the new one kept. `up --help` and `status --help` describe what they do today, including what `data.connection` holds in `status --json`. ([#341](https://github.com/Harry-kp/vortix/pull/341))\n- **`vortix killswitch off` without root asks for sudo.** It failed with an internal ownership error and exit code 1; it now exits 2 with \"Re-run with: sudo vortix killswitch off\", like every other mode change. ([#341](https://github.com/Harry-kp/vortix/pull/341))\n\n### Changed\n\n- **`vortix update` only updates a Cargo install.** It used to run `cargo install` whatever the install method; for Homebrew, a package, npm or a source checkout it now exits 1 and names the right way to update, such as `brew upgrade vortix`. ([#341](https://github.com/Harry-kp/vortix/pull/341))\n\n## Install vortix 0.5.2\n\n### Install prebuilt binaries via shell script\n\n```sh\ncurl --proto '=https' --tlsv1.2 -LsSf https://github.com/Harry-kp/vortix/releases/download/v0.5.2/vortix-installer.sh | sh\n```\n\n### Install prebuilt binaries via Homebrew\n\n```sh\nbrew install Harry-kp/tap/vortix\n```\n\n### Install prebuilt binaries into your npm project\n\n```sh\nnpm install @harry-kp/vortix@0.5.2\n```\n\n## Download vortix 0.5.2\n\n|  File  | Platform | Checksum |\n|--------|----------|----------|\n| [vortix-aarch64-apple-darwin.tar.xz](https://github.com/Harry-kp/vortix/releases/download/v0.5.2/vortix-aarch64-apple-darwin.tar.xz) | Apple Silicon macOS | [checksum](https://github.com/Harry-kp/vortix/releases/download/v0.5.2/vortix-aarch64-apple-darwin.tar.xz.sha256) |\n| [vortix-x86_64-apple-darwin.tar.xz](https://github.com/Harry-kp/vortix/releases/download/v0.5.2/vortix-x86_64-apple-darwin.tar.xz) | Intel macOS | [checksum](https://github.com/Harry-kp/vortix/releases/download/v0.5.2/vortix-x86_64-apple-darwin.tar.xz.sha256) |\n| [vortix-aarch64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.xz](https://github.com/Harry-kp/vortix/releases/download/v0.5.2/vortix-aarch64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.xz) | ARM64 Linux | [checksum](https://github.com/Harry-kp/vortix/releases/download/v0.5.2/vortix-aarch64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.xz.sha256) |\n| [vortix-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.xz](https://github.com/Harry-kp/vortix/releases/download/v0.5.2/vortix-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.xz) | x64 Linux | [checksum](https://github.com/Harry-kp/vortix/releases/download/v0.5.2/vortix-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.xz.sha256) |\n| [vortix-aarch64-unknown-linux-musl.tar.xz](https://github.com/Harry-kp/vortix/releases/download/v0.5.2/vortix-aarch64-unknown-linux-musl.tar.xz) | ARM64 MUSL Linux | [checksum](https://github.com/Harry-kp/vortix/releases/download/v0.5.2/vortix-aarch64-unknown-linux-musl.tar.xz.sha256) |\n| [vortix-x86_64-unknown-linux-musl.tar.xz](https://github.com/Harry-kp/vortix/releases/download/v0.5.2/vortix-x86_64-unknown-linux-musl.tar.xz) | x64 MUSL Linux | [checksum](https://github.com/Harry-kp/vortix/releases/download/v0.5.2/vortix-x86_64-unknown-linux-musl.tar.xz.sha256) |\n\n\n"}
